  - messageText: Hey, I had to leave the house a little earlier than usual since
      traffic was backed up. The cat should be wandering around. Also I won't be
      home till late again, I've gotta run to the health food store after work. Hope
      you have a good day.
    messagePhase: 1
    isPlayerMessage: 0
    isSent: 0
    isResponse: 0
    isResponseTo: 
    hasResponse: 0
    responseIs: 
  - messageText: "We always seem to miss each other lately. We\u2019ll have to make
      some time to chat soon."
    messagePhase: 1
    isPlayerMessage: 1
    isSent: 0
    isResponse: 0
    isResponseTo: 
    hasResponse: 1
    responseIs: Yeah, we probably should,  maybe over lunch or something.
  - messageText: Yeah, we probably should,  maybe over lunch or something.
