  - messageText: Left for work, I noticed all the new additions to the apartment.
      They look... good. We should probably talk soon though. I think we should go
      over some things.
    messagePhase: 2
    isPlayerMessage: 0
    isSent: 0
    isResponse: 0
    isResponseTo: 
    hasResponse: 0
    responseIs: 
  - messageText: I agree. We need to talk.
    messagePhase: 2
    isPlayerMessage: 1
    isSent: 0
    isResponse: 0
    isResponseTo: 
    hasResponse: 1
    responseIs: "Yeah\u2026 I'll be home tomorrow morning. We can chat then. See
      ya."
  - messageText: "Yeah\u2026 I'll be home tomorrow morning. We can chat then. Maybe
